[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 16681.349, "timestamp": "04:38:01", "text": "因为我感觉，呃，我好像……"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16683.67, "timestamp": "04:38:03", "text": "三"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16686.789, "timestamp": "04:38:06", "text": "我需要制作一把斧头。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16688.31, "timestamp": "04:38:08", "text": "康复。回基地吧，因为我可以"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16690.869, "timestamp": "04:38:10", "text": "治愈你自己。哦，是的，我会回来的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16693.59, "timestamp": "04:38:13", "text": "根据。我忘了我的角色也是一个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16698.709, "timestamp": "04:38:18", "text": "辅助角色。好吧，就像每个呃我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16700.39, "timestamp": "04:38:20", "text": "我的意思是，雷内，我需要接受治疗。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16702.789, "timestamp": "04:38:22", "text": "道路。我的HP只剩一半了。如果可以的话，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16705.59, "timestamp": "04:38:25", "text": "我要回去继续爬蜘蛛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16706.949, "timestamp": "04:38:26", "text": "因为他们实际上杀死了很多"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16709.029, "timestamp": "04:38:29", "text": "拉屎。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16711.349, "timestamp": "04:38:31", "text": "是的，顺便一提，你可以吃怪物。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16713.99, "timestamp": "04:38:33", "text": "杀死蜘蛛。务必确认一下。是的，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16716.07, "timestamp": "04:38:36", "text": "如果你吃东西，请注意你的HP值。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16718.551, "timestamp": "04:38:38", "text": "怪物。你们在哪儿？因为它"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16720.949, "timestamp": "04:38:40", "text": "消耗你的生命值"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16723.83, "timestamp": "04:38:43", "text": "而且还会让人丧失一些理智。雷内，我是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16726.709, "timestamp": "04:38:46", "text": "去找你。我需要一些HP。过来"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16732.47, "timestamp": "04:38:52", "text": "对，把那些灵魂给我。我知道我们是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16734.551, "timestamp": "04:38:54", "text": "这里。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 16738.629, "timestamp": "04:38:58", "text": "你在哪里？跌到红线了，宝贝。"}]